@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra may chu dang chay -> 200
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop -> 201 + Location, status = received
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr" }

### 4. Doc lai luot nop vua tao -> 200 (bam nhieu lan: received -> processing -> graded)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Nop bai thieu du lieu -> 400 + ApiError (INVALID_SUBMISSION)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "", "repositoryUrl": "" }

### 6. Nop bai cho bai tap 99 khong ton tai -> 404 + ApiError (ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr" }

### 7. Doc luot nop voi id rong -> 404 + ApiError (SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bat tay SignalR (negotiate) -> 200 + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai duong dan hub -> 404
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 10. Nop bai cho bai tap da dong -> 400 + ApiError (ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr" }
